e Programs (SPAP)** — drug cost reduction. Immediate nursing home placement without assessing community-based Medicaid options deprives the family of preferred and often less expensive alternatives. (Ref: Hazzard''s Ch. 17; AGS Geriatrics At Your Fingertips; Current Diagnosis & Treatment: Geriatrics Ch. 4)'),
